*Beta 39.0: New card: Butterflies. COMMON. COST 1. ATK 1. HP 1. EFFECT: Dust: Add a random <= 3G spell to your hand. 
*Beta 45.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Haste. Dust: Add a random <= 3G spell to your hand. 
**This change allowed Butterflies to attack the turn it was played in order to die and trigger its Dust effect.
*Beta 54.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Haste. Magic: Look at 2 random spells costing 1 or less G and choose one. Add it to your hand.
**This version of Butterflies was akin to a miniature version of [[Bone Box]].
**[[Magic Crystal]] was released in Beta 54.0. Butterflies functioned as a setup card for Magic Crystal. Scepter and Shock decks, on the other hand, required => 2 G spells which were not in the range of Butterflies.
*Beta 57.0: HP 1 > 2. EFFECT UPDATE: Taunt. Magic: Look at 2 random spells costing 1 or less G and choose one. Add it to your hand.
*Beta 60.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Magic: Look at 2 spells costing 1 or less G. Choose one to add to the top of your deck. Dust: Draw a spell.
*Beta 60.1: HP 2 > 3.
*Beta 61.1: EFFECT UPDATE: Dust: Draw a spell.
*Beta 62.0: HP 3 > 2.

